self.KB_CONTENT["card:784089"]={"id":"card:784089","ty":"card","sourceId":"784089","title":"『資產採購變更單憑證』中的『選擇列印狀態』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"變更單","keywords":["變更單","憑證","資產","採購"],"y":"other","answer":"* 區分為Y.已列印、N.未列印及全部 (不必篩選列印次數)。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
self.KB_CONTENT["card:785125"]={"id":"card:785125","ty":"card","sourceId":"785125","title":"『底稿-來源單據記錄表』中的『選擇拋轉狀態』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"分錄","keywords":["分錄","狀態","拋轉","底稿"],"y":"other","answer":"* 分錄底稿之拋轉狀態區分為Y.已拋轉、N.未拋轉及全部。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
