self.KB_CONTENT["card:784830"]={"id":"card:784830","ty":"card","sourceId":"784830","title":"『資產折舊憑証』中的『選擇FAX/Email傳送方式 (C1)』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"資產","keywords":["資產","折舊","傳送","自訂"],"y":"other","answer":"* 尚未購買『FAX/Email處理系統』(FEP)，此欄位需隱藏。* 計3.FAX To 自訂對象及4.Email To 自訂對象。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
